{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SacriShot Matrix</strong></i> is a light gun-style first-person shooter with mild rogue-like elements. You'll play as a challenger breaking taboos, embarking on a journey through the \u300eShadow World\u300f accompanied by Asmodeus, the Sin of Lust...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is a world where pornography is forbidden.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/extras/be265f1f0edf34b6b17d8d97a2d1a4bb.poster.avif?t=1756577872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/extras/be265f1f0edf34b6b17d8d97a2d1a4bb.webm?t=1756577872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/extras/be265f1f0edf34b6b17d8d97a2d1a4bb.mp4?t=1756577872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congressmen suddenly fell into a trance-like state, jointly enacting <i>the Public Order and Good Morality Law</i> that bans all sexually explicit content.<br>Red-light districts, sex-toys stores and even magazine racks in convenience stores all were eradicated overnight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this oppressive world, you met Asmodeus. Signing a soul-binding pact, she'll guide your rebellion against the Act...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build up your own Runes, Battle in Shadows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/extras/75d5376a6f05644cbd46d6c663c78064.poster.avif?t=1756577872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/extras/75d5376a6f05644cbd46d6c663c78064.webm?t=1756577872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/extras/75d5376a6f05644cbd46d6c663c78064.mp4?t=1756577872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asmodeus transforms your manhood into a gun firing desire-bullets. Wield this weapon against demonic projections of human lust and malice within the mental realm \u2013 the Shadow World.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/extras/fadad24f00cc0cb86a14c6e10bce2e59.poster.avif?t=1756577872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/extras/fadad24f00cc0cb86a14c6e10bce2e59.webm?t=1756577872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/extras/fadad24f00cc0cb86a14c6e10bce2e59.mp4?t=1756577872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert earned mana coins into runes branded upon Asmodeus' form. Customize your combat build freely. Through pain and ecstasy, she'll grant you devastating new powers...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Confront the Sins: Conquer or Submit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/extras/f26a11cdbaecdce872562d32df7c11cf.poster.avif?t=1756577872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/extras/f26a11cdbaecdce872562d32df7c11cf.webm?t=1756577872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/extras/f26a11cdbaecdce872562d32df7c11cf.mp4?t=1756577872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Act was forged by Mammon of Greed and Lucifer of Pride. Through ritual magic in the Shadow World, they brainwashed politicians.<br>Venture deep into their Domains within the Shadow World to defeat them. Brand your sigil upon them to claim absolute mastery...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/extras/b8d9ff970416fe1254c90853c3c4eb4a.poster.avif?t=1756577872\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/extras/b8d9ff970416fe1254c90853c3c4eb4a.webm?t=1756577872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/extras/b8d9ff970416fe1254c90853c3c4eb4a.mp4?t=1756577872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or kneel in eternal submission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2420400?t=1756577872","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2420400?t=1756577872","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/4f0d00c1e807109620fb685a46e93f08dbbd7b37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756577872","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420400/4f0d00c1e807109620fb685a46e93f08dbbd7b37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756577872","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"- There are sexy poses and som